  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways to Employment in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The Pathways to Employment project&lt;/b&gt; aims at empowering youth in Palestine: young people develop into active and critical citizens, ready for local and global challenges through improved education, training, guidance and access to employment. The project objectives are (1) to employ more young women and men in Palestine in decent work conditions, or (2) to have their own income-generating business.</narrative>
  </description>
